1
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:06,332
This video shows you how to upgrade smeltr: back up first,

2
00:00:06,332 --> 00:00:09,230
then the leader, then each worker.

3
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:12,055
Open Admin, System, General.

4
00:00:12,055 --> 00:00:15,723
It shows the version the leader runs.

5
00:00:15,723 --> 00:00:17,230
Here, 1.1.0.

6
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:20,871
Read the release notes of the new version before you upgrade,

7
00:00:20,871 --> 00:00:24,070
and try the upgrade on a copy of your setup first.

8
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:30,793
Stop the leader, and back up its data and key, as in Back up and restore the leader.

9
00:00:32,480 --> 00:00:37,833
Keep the old image too, so you can go back to the old version with that backup.

10
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:47,559
Point SMELTR_IMAGE, in .env, at the new image.

11
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:54,095
Start the leader on it.

12
00:00:54,095 --> 00:00:58,558
It upgrades its data as it starts, with no manual step.

13
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:03,021
Sign in again.

14
00:01:03,021 --> 00:01:07,977
worker-2 still runs 1.1.0, so Status shows it On another build.

15
00:01:07,977 --> 00:01:12,668
It keeps running what it has, and takes nothing new.

16
00:01:19,880 --> 00:01:21,552
Upgrade each worker next.

17
00:01:21,552 --> 00:01:27,110
Remove its container, and run it again on the new image, with the same volume.

18
00:01:27,160 --> 00:01:31,104
It keeps its identity, so it needs no new enrollment.

19
00:01:35,600 --> 00:01:39,326
Both workers now run the new version, on the same commit.

20
00:01:39,326 --> 00:01:42,868
Check that rows still flow before you finish.

21
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:47,023
Check on learning.

22
00:01:47,223 --> 00:01:50,708
What do you do before you upgrade the leader?

23
00:01:55,108 --> 00:02:00,122
Stop it, back up its data and key, and keep the old image.

24
00:02:01,022 --> 00:02:02,270
That's Run a fleet.

25
00:02:02,270 --> 00:02:07,198
You found what's wrong, sent the fleet's logs and metrics to your platform,

26
00:02:07,198 --> 00:02:12,397
got alerted, sized a worker, backed up the leader and upgraded smeltr.
